toyFaithful i σ τ h p = ∣_∣₁ (StepD ℕ Bool Bool Bool Bool Bool toyQuorum toyIn toyCircuit toyRun ℕ (isSetℕ ℕ) toyHeight toyArtifact toyCommittee toyConstitution toyApply toyAdvance 0 toyCore toyIsPropCore toyCore₀ σ τ) (step ℕ Bool Bool Bool Bool Bool toyQuorum toyIn toyCircuit toyRun ℕ (isSetℕ ℕ) toyHeight toyArtifact toyCommittee toyConstitution toyApply toyAdvance 0 toyCore toyIsPropCore toyCore₀ σ τ true ([] Bool) true refl p (λ (c : toyCore σ) → c))

